<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="about-section">
  <div class="about-hero">
    <h1>About BookStore MVC</h1>
    <p class="lead">Your trusted source for books and knowledge</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-content">
    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>BookStore MVC is dedicated to making books accessible to everyone. We believe that reading enriches lives and expands minds. Our mission is to provide a diverse collection of books across all genres, ensuring that every reader finds something they love.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>Founded in 2020, BookStore MVC started as a passion project to build a modern, user-friendly bookstore. Over the years, we've grown into a comprehensive platform where readers can discover, browse, and manage their favorite books. We're committed to continuous improvement and innovation in the digital bookstore space.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li><strong>Wide Selection:</strong> Browse thousands of books across multiple genres</li>
        <li><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Intuitive interface for seamless browsing and management</li>
        <li><strong>Modern Technology:</strong> Built with the latest web technologies for the best experience</li>
        <li><strong>Affordable Prices:</strong> Competitive pricing on all our books</li>
        <li><strong>Quick Support:</strong> Dedicated customer service team ready to help</li>
        <li><strong>Secure Transactions:</strong> Safe and secure payment processing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>Our Team</h2>
      <p>We have a talented team of book enthusiasts, developers, and designers who work together to bring you the best bookstore experience. Our team is passionate about books and technology, and we're always looking for ways to improve.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-stats">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>10,000+</h3>
        <p>Books in Collection</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>50,000+</h3>
        <p>Happy Customers</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>100+</h3>
        <p>Book Categories</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>24/7</h3>
        <p>Customer Support</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-section">
    <h2>Ready to Start Reading?</h2>
    <p>Explore our collection and find your next favorite book.</p>
    <a href="/books" class="btn btn-primary">Browse All Books</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
